This program downloads the dlssg_for_sm86 mod from its author's GitHub releases
(https://github.com/sdli1995/dlssg_for_sm86) and installs it into game folders.
The mod, its runtime and the NVIDIA nvngx_* libraries are NOT part of this
project and remain subject to their own authors' terms.
